      "source": "@log/「危ない！」魔力の渦の発生に気がついた仲間が、読書を中断させた。",
      "target": "“위험해!” 마력의 소용돌이를 알아챈 동료가 독서를 멈춰 세웠다.",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:218136"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "source_aliases": [
        "@log/Ally who noticed the occurrence of vortex of magic, was interrupted reading."
      ]
    },
    {
